{"pull": {"id": "number:16686", "number": 16686, "title": "KAFKA-16985: Ensure consumer attempts to send leave request on close even if interrupted", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2024-07-24T23:17:07Z", "closed_at": "2024-11-13T19:26:40Z", "merged_at": "2024-11-13T19:26:40Z", "user": {"login": "kirktrue", "id": 92057, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkyMDU3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92057?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue", "html_url": "https://github.com/kirktrue", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "This change ensures that `AsyncKafkaConsumer` attempts to leave the group cleanly upon `close()`, regardless of the timeout or interrupts. The application thread will invoke the `ConsumerRebalanceListener`’s callback, if present, to release the assignment, and then enqueue a `LeaveGroupOnClose` for the background thread. The background thread will send out the “leave group” heartbeat, and will notify the application thread (if still waiting) upon response.\r\n\r\n### Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)\r\n- [ ] Verify design and implementation \r\n- [ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status\r\n- [ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)\r\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6T